[music reactor]
The drone drops, sparking, and lies
still.

The reactor room is a cathedral of heat.
At its heart, behind glass, something
burns too brightly to look at.

One console is lit. It says:

CONTAINMENT CONTROL    LOCKED
LOCKED BY              MERIDIAN

