> 1

A broad, sweating man is stacking crates
against a pod hatch that won't open. His
jumpsuit says T. VASZ, QUARTERMASTER.

He looks up at you, and there is nothing
in his face at all. No recognition. You
have stood here and talked with him
before, and he has never seen you in his
life.

"You're the contractor?" he says, word
for word. "Thank every star."

1. Tell him what he's about to say
2. Ask him about the captain's safe
3. Leave him to his crates
> 3

The ring corridor curves away in both
directions, rising out of sight. People
run past carrying the wrong things: a
plant, a guitar, a box of mugs.

Every screen: 11 minutes.

A voice comes from the speakers, the
same voice as the train. "Containment
failure in 11 minutes. Please make your
way to an escape pod. The escape pods
are not working. I'm sorry."

~ Again ~

You stop in the middle of the ring and
let the station run past you.

Eighteen minutes. A dead freighter you
could set a watch by. A man who will
never remember your name, however many
times you tell him. A safe at the top of
the spine.

And one voice, in your ear, that
remembers everything.

MERIDIAN locked the reactor. MERIDIAN is
doing this on purpose. And MERIDIAN said
there has to be another time.

The screens say 11 minutes. For the
first time since you stepped off the
train, it doesn't feel like very long,
and it doesn't feel like very short. It
feels like a door.

You go to find the crew.

~ The Crew ~

The ring runs past you: the same people,
the same things in their arms. Every
screen says 10 minutes.

1. Teodor, at the pods
2. Dr Kerr and her engineer
3. Pell, in hydroponics
4. The captain, up the spine
5. The reactor
6. Sit by a viewport and wait
> 3

Pell sits in the soil under the violet
lamps, not running anywhere.

1. Ask her about the captain's safe
2. Ask her what the seeds are for
3. Back to the ring
> 1

"Ines? She'd never tell me." Pell pulls
a weed. "But she uses one code for
everything. Her daughter's name: ASHA.
She told me once, at a party nobody else
remembers."

1. Ask her what the seeds are for
2. Back to the ring
> 2

