~ The Safe ~

[picture pic08]
The captain's quarters: a bunk, a
photograph of a girl, and a safe with a
keypad.

1. Type ASHA
2. Leave
> 1

The safe opens with a sigh of cold air.
Not money: a frosted cylinder the size
of a thermos, humming. A label in Pell's
hand: SECTOR SEED VAULT. ALL CROPS. KEEP
COLD.

"So that's what the Stationmaster
wants," says MERIDIAN, in your ear. "The
one thing here that could outlive all of
us."

1. Look at the seed vault
2. Leave
> 2

The ring runs past you: the same people,
the same things in their arms. Every
