~ The Last Loop ~

[music last_loop]
"You know all of it now," says MERIDIAN,
in your ear. "So do I. One more time,
then. This time I won't take it back.
Whatever you do in the next eighteen
minutes stays done."

The screens go white.

1. Let the loop go round, one last time
> 1

[picture pic02]
Dock 3. Red light, klaxons, 18:00, for
the last time. You don't wait for the
voice.

