~ Home ~

[music home]
The train is waiting, as if it always
knew. Through the window, Kepler-Nine
goes white.

Somewhere out there, five escape pods
are drifting home.

[picture pic09]
The Waystation. The Stationmaster is
waiting on the platform, ledger open.

"Welcome back. You were eighteen
minutes." It does not say which
eighteen.

1. Hand over the seed vault
2. Keep the seeds
> 1

The Stationmaster holds the vault the
way you'd hold a sleeping child. "Thank
you," it says, and means it, and writes
something in the ledger that makes your
Debt smaller.

[music fin]
-- EIGHTEEN MINUTES --
The end.

~ Departure complete ~

